        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>微积分公式</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]},\n      svg: {fontCache: 'global'}\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { margin: 0; background: #fff; }\n    body {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      padding: 12px 35px 13px 40px;\n      color: #171717;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .top-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1.45fr 1.5fr;\n      column-gap: 10px;\n      row-gap: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .top-grid .blank { visibility: hidden; }\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 13px 0;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .rules {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 35px;\n      row-gap: 15px;\n      margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .basic {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.05fr;\n      column-gap: 13px;\n      row-gap: 17px;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .basic .wide { grid-column: 1 / span 2; }\n    .supplement {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 42px;\n      row-gap: 16px;\n      margin: 0 0 15px 4px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .formula { min-height: 17px; }\n    .table-title {\n      margin: 0 0 3px 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    table {\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      width: 100%;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    th, td {\n      border: 1px solid #9b9b9b;\n      height: 32px;\n      padding: 3px 7px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      text-align: left;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    th {\n      height: 18px;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    td:last-child {\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"top-grid\">\n    <div>② $d\\left(\\log_a x\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{x\\ln a}\\,dx$</div>\n    <div>③ $d\\left(\\arcsin x\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx$</div>\n    <div>④ $d\\left(\\arccos x\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx$</div>\n    <div>⑤ $d\\left(\\arctan x\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}\\,dx$</div>\n    <div>⑥ $d\\left(\\operatorname{arccot}x\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}\\,dx$</div>\n    <div class=\"blank\">.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>六、微分法则</h2>\n  <div class=\"rules\">\n    <div class=\"formula\">(1) $d(u\\pm v)=du\\pm dv$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(2) $d(cu)=cdu$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(3) $d(uv)=vdu+udv$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(4) $d\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right)=\\dfrac{vdu-udv}{v^2}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>七、基本积分公式</h2>\n  <div class=\"basic\">\n    <div class=\"formula\">(1) $\\int kdx=kx+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(2) $\\int x^\\mu dx=\\dfrac{x^{\\mu+1}}{\\mu+1}+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(3) $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x}=\\ln|x|+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">(4) $\\int a^x dx=\\dfrac{a^x}{\\ln a}+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(5) $\\int e^x dx=e^x+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(6) $\\int\\cos xdx=\\sin x+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">(7) $\\int\\sin xdx=-\\cos x+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(8) $\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\cos^2x}dx=\\int\\sec^2x\\,dx=\\tan x+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(9) $\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2x}dx=\\int\\csc^2x\\,dx=-\\cot x+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula wide\">(10) $\\int\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}dx=\\arctan x+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">(11) $\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx=\\arcsin x+c$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>八、补充积分公式</h2>\n  <div class=\"supplement\">\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\tan xdx=-\\ln|\\cos x|+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\cot xdx=\\ln|\\sin x|+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\sec xdx=\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\csc xdx=\\ln|\\csc x-\\cot x|+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\dfrac{1}{a^2+x^2}dx=\\dfrac{1}{a}\\arctan\\dfrac{x}{a}+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\dfrac{1}{x^2-a^2}dx=\\dfrac{1}{2a}\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-a}{x+a}\\right|+c$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}dx=\\arcsin\\dfrac{x}{a}+c$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">$\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}dx=\\ln\\left|x+\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\right|+c$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"table-title\">九、分部积分法公式</div>\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:56%\">\n      <col style=\"width:44%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>积分型</th>\n        <th>换元公式</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(ax+b)dx=\\dfrac{1}{a}\\int f(ax+b)d(ax+b)$</td>\n        <td>$u=ax+b$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(x^n)x^{n-1}dx=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\int f(x^n)d(x^n)$</td>\n        <td>$u=x^n$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\ln x)\\dfrac{1}{x}\\,dx=\\int f(\\ln x)d(\\ln x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\ln x$</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
